The project centres on developing the land adjacent to Hatchmoor Road, Great Torrington, Devon UK with a view to attracting businesses to create a local employment hub. 
The project therefore comprises of the: 
• Construction of a new highway junction and estate road off Hatchmoor Road, along with associated offsite highway improvements to support the site; 
• Installation of drainage infrastructure for both surface and foul water, including the potential use of soakaways for sustainable surface water management; 
• Upgrading of existing electrical and fibre networks to ensure sufficient capacity for the proposed development; 
• Delivery of employment buildings, through the construction of various units of varying sizes.

